        "size": "s",
        "font": "draw",
        "text": "💡 The xDS Connection\n\nEach 'doll' maps to an Envoy Discovery Service (xDS):\n\n• Listener → LDS\n• TLS / Certs → SDS\n• Route Config → RDS\n• Cluster Pool → CDS\n• Pod Endpoints → EDS\n\nDynamic updates reload only the inner doll needed!",
        "align": "start",
        "verticalAlign": "start",
        "growY": 0,
        "url": ""
