        "color": "light-violet",
        "labelColor": "black",
        "fill": "semi",
        "dash": "draw",
        "size": "s",
        "font": "draw",
        "text": "🎯 Why Matryoshka?\n\n1. Layer-by-Layer Decapsulation:\nOuter doll unpacks TCP/TLS, inner doll unpacks HTTP, core routes to the Pod.\n\n2. YAML Configuration:\nEnvoy config literally nests these objects inside each other.\n\n3. Blast Radius:\nInner doll changes (EDS) are cheap & frequent; outer changes (LDS) are rare.",
        "align": "start",
        "verticalAlign": "start",
        "growY": 0,
        "url": ""
